<title>UK: Israel to issue $200 million five-year Eurobond.</title>
<headline>Israel to issue $200 million five-year Eurobond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Israel will launch a $200 million five-year Eurobond on Thursday, Israeli ministry of finance director-general David Brodet told bankers on Wednesday.</p>
<p>&quot;We will launch a $200 million five-year Eurobond. The spread will be around 50 basis points (over U.S. Treasuries),&quot; said Brodet, speaking at a presentation to bankers in London.</p>
</text>
